{"type":"message","id":"bb09d86b","parentId":"c52ebe80","timestamp":"2026-06-03T14:46:37.733Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /history endpoint works with `X-API-Key` header but /send doesn't seem to work with the same authentication. The error code 1101 from /send seems to be an authentication issue (even though it worked for /history with the same header).\n\nWait - let me re-read the responses. For /history with X-API-Key: *** returned data successfully. For /send with X-API-Key: *** returned \"error code: 1101\". This suggests the /send endpoint might need different authentication or a different format.\n\nBut the health endpoint returned \"OK\" without any auth. And /api returned \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" without auth.\n\nThe version info response from /api suggests this is a Cloudflare Worker. Error code 1101 from Cloudflare typically means \"Workers Error\" - something in the worker itself is failing.\n\nLet me try a different approach - maybe there's a form-encoded format or different JSON structure needed.\n","thinkingSignature":"1a01c89c877a64a1a3584ff3dea0249211a7563c4dd018c17a1103a24ab5ef0d"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_hwsbr5mkguiz_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try different JSON body structures\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"message\":\"Heartbeat 14:45 UTC\"}' 2>&1\n\necho \"---\"\n\n# Try without threadId in root\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"id\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat test\",\"type\":\"message\"}' 2>&1\n\necho \"---\"\n\n# Check raw ip - maybe there's rate limiting or something\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" 2>&1 | head -5","timeout":20}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":270,"output":449,"cacheRead":23360,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24079,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780497991353,"responseId":"066f71478ac43043caabac4ac9db13ca"}}
