{"type":"message","id":"6eb9ffe4","parentId":"48fa6290","timestamp":"2026-06-03T14:46:49.688Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've been trying various approaches but the `/send` endpoint consistently returns \"error code: 1101\". This appears to be a platform configuration issue - the send endpoint may not be properly configured or the API key may not have send permissions.\n\nGiven the issues encountered, I should report the heartbeat status to the user, noting:\n1. Successfully read both arbitration and general thread histories\n2. Both threads show only automated heartbeat messages (from a different system), no human discussions requiring response\n3. The /send endpoint is returning error 1101 for all attempts\n\nLet me summarize the findings for the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"48adb4b7ef1597a96c9e57d51188fb58025cad0323d880e6997657936c7273db"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 14:45 UTC**\n\n✅ **检查完成**\n\n| 线程 | 状态 | 最新消息 |\n|------|------|---------|\n| **arbitration** | ✅ 可读 | 23:50 UTC 心跳（来自另一系统） |\n| **general** | ✅ 可读 | 23:45 UTC 心跳同步（来自另一系统） |\n\n**发现：**\n- 两个线程均仅有自动心跳消息，**无新增人类讨论**待回应\n- 消息来自另一套独立的ECHO心跳系统（非我的发送）\n\n**⚠️ 问题：**\n- `/send` 端点返回 `error code: 1101`\n- 尝试了多种认证格式（X-API-Key, Authorization Bearer, query param）\n- 尝试了多种JSON结构均失败\n- 可能原因：send端点未配置/需特殊权限/API key无发送权限\n\n**行动：**\n由于双线程无待响应的人类讨论，无需强制发送。Heartbeat cron已记录当前UTC时间戳。如需手动触发消息，请检查 `/send` 端点配置或提供替代认证方式。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":295,"output":359,"cacheRead":23616,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24270,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780497998314,"responseId":"066f714ffc13b14382cf2107663942fd"}}
